Package: NICHESv2
Type: Package
Title: Spatial Cell-to-Cell Ligand-Receptor Communication Analysis
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Nuoya", "Wang",
           email = "nuoya.wang@yale.edu",
           role  = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
    person("Micha Sam Brickman", "Raredon",
           role  = c("aut", "cph")))
Description: Computes ligand-receptor (LR) signaling scores between pairs of
    cells in spatial and non-spatial single-cell transcriptomics data. Results
    are held in a memory-efficient, sparse long-format S3 class with per-cell
    neighborhood aggregation for downstream analysis. Supports single-gene and
    multi-gene complex ligands and receptors. Built-in loaders are provided for
    the ConnectomeDB2025 (default), FANTOM5, and OmniPath LR databases.
